# The kit scripts regenerate several registries byte-for-byte (rebuild-tasks-index, rebuild-catalog)
# and `sdd:validate` compares them against what is on disk. Keep everything under sdd/ LF on every
# OS so that comparison is about content, never about line endings (a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check out CRLF and fail the freshness checks on every run).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
